{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-234",
  "title": "fsAdapter",
  "author": "person:jane-brew:001",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "fsAdapter"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Bridging the gap between the **real filesystem** (on desktop) and the **WebContainer virtual filesystem** (in-browser) is essentially solving for:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Data translation**: Syncing files between two distinct FS environments."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Transport**: Moving file data and metadata across a network or browser boundary."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Runtime consistency**: Ensuring logic behaves identically despite FS context."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Let’s map this out."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "🧱 Bridging Layers Overview"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "A. **Shared Logic Layer** (Core)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-10",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Written in TypeScript/JavaScript."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-11",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Exposes:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-13",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- `loadVault()`"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- `getChangesSince(timestamp)`"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- `applyChanges(diff)`"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- `resolveConflicts()`"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- File parser(s), indexer, metadata extractor."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Lives in:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-19",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Node.js (desktop)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-20",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "WebContainer (browser)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-22",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "B. **File System Adapter Layer**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This abstracts the actual file system access."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "interface VaultAdapter {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-26",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "readFile(path: string): Promise<string>;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-27",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "writeFile(path: string, contents: string): Promise<void>;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-28",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "listFiles(): Promise<string[]>;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-29",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "watchFiles?(callback: (event: FSChangeEvent) => void): void;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-30",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-31",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-32",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Implementations:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-36",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-33",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "`DesktopVaultAdapter` (uses Node `fs`)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-34",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "`WebContainerVaultAdapter` (uses WebContainer APIs)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-35",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "(Optional) `BrowserVaultAdapter` (uses IndexedDB or File System Access API)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-37",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "C. **Sync Transport Layer**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-38",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Handles transmission of diffs/changes."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-41",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-39",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Pull/push diff packages (JSON or binary)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-40",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Could be:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-42",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- HTTP endpoint (simple REST API)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-43",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- WebSocket stream"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-44",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Peer-to-peer (WebRTC, Hypercore, Yjs)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-45",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Cloud drive (Dropbox API, etc.)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-46",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "D. **Bridge Logic**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-47",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Glue code to sync between real FS and WebContainer FS."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-48",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "On desktop:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-49",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-50",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "const changes = await desktopVault.getChangesSince(lastSync);"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-51",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "await syncAPI.pushChanges(changes);"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-52",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-53",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "On web:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-54",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-55",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "const changes = await syncAPI.pullChanges(since);"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-56",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "await webContainerVault.applyChanges(changes);"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-57",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-58",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-59",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "🔁 One-Way Sync Example (Desktop → Web)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-60",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Desktop App**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-61",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Scans local vault using `DesktopVaultAdapter`."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-62",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Builds diff (`getChangesSince(lastSync)`)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-63",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Pushes to a sync endpoint."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-64",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Web App**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-65",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Starts a WebContainer."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-66",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Initializes `WebContainerVaultAdapter` (writes to its VFS)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-67",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Pulls changes from endpoint and writes into WebContainer FS."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-68",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Executes same logic (`indexVault`, `search`, etc.) as desktop."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-69",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-70",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "🌐 Transport Layer Sketch (Push/Pull)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-71",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-72",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "// Push endpoint"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-73",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "POST /sync/push"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-74",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Body: {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-75",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "vaultId: \"user123\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-76",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "changes: [ { path: \"notes/todo.md\", content: \"...\" }, ... ]"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-77",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-78",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "// Pull endpoint"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-79",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "GET /sync/pull?vaultId=user123&since=timestamp"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-80",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Returns: { changes: [...] }"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-81",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-82",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-83",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "🧬 Why This Works"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-87",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-84",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Everything is modular and testable."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-85",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Logic is runtime-agnostic."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-86",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "You separate:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-88",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Intent** (I want to sync)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-89",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Access** (how to read/write files)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-90",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Execution** (where it runs)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-91",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-92",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Would you like a working TypeScript skeleton of this pattern? Or perhaps a deep dive into syncing strategies like timestamps vs content hashes vs CRDTs?"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}